{"version":1,"_lintCache":"exempt","_note":"单条查询便宜,且「已/未回复」必须新鲜(在 ASC 里回完复回来就该看到已回复),刻意不做 G23 首屏缓存。","actions":[{"id":"csq","action":"credential.state","params":{"id":"asc"},"_note":"凭证闸第一步:纯本地查表,零网络。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_bcs","value":"1"},"_note":"屏障(勿删):credential.state 之后紧邻的节点读不到它的结果。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"csB","value":"$[if::(eq::(${csq.state},bound),1,0)]"},"_note":"1 = 已绑 `asc`;0 = 没绑 / 已失效 → 下面带凭证的请求一律不发。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"today","value":"$[parseDate::(formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"},"_note":"今天 0 点(本地时区)。天数差按自然日算。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rid","value":"${id}"}},{"_note":"凭证闸(gen_appstore.py 出口改写,appstore-merged §13):没绑 `asc` 就不发这个请求。`required:false` 时宿主不拦,不包这一层就会匿名打 ASC 拿 401。","op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${csB},1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"id":"r","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/customerReviews/${rid}?include=response","method":"GET","formatType":"json","credential":"asc"}}]},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b0","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"errMsg","value":"$[get::(index::(${r.errors},0),detail)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ok","value":"$[if::(eq::(${r},),0,if::(gt::(length::(${errMsg}),0),0,1))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"tt","value":"${r.data.attributes.title}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"bd","value":"${r.data.attributes.body}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nk","value":"$[get::(${r.data.attributes},reviewerNickname)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ter","value":"$[get::(${r.data.attributes},territory)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rt","value":"$[get::(${r.data.attributes},rating)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"st","value":"$[if::(ge::(${rt},5),★★★★★,if::(ge::(${rt},4),★★★★,if::(ge::(${rt},3),★★★,if::(ge::(${rt},2),★★,if::(ge::(${rt},1),★,)))))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nr","value":"$[if::(eq::(${r.data.relationships.response.data},),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rpB","value":"${r.included[0].attributes.responseBody}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rpIso","value":"$[get::(index::(${r.included},0),attributes)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rpD0","value":"$[get::(${rpIso},lastModifiedDate)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rvIso","value":"${r.data.attributes.createdDate}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dAgo_d","value":"$[subString::(${rvIso},0,10)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dAgo_ms","value":"$[parseDate::(${dAgo_d},yyyy-MM-dd)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dAgo","value":"$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${dAgo_ms},0),1),round::(calc::((${today}-${dAgo_ms})/86400000),0),)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rpD_d","value":"$[subString::(${rpD0},0,10)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rpD_ms","value":"$[parseDate::(${rpD_d},yyyy-MM-dd)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rpD","value":"$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${rpD_ms},0),1),round::(calc::((${today}-${rpD_ms})/86400000),0),)]"}},{"action":"resultFilter","params":{"keys":["ok","errMsg","tt","bd","nk","ter","st","rt","nr","rpB","rpD","dAgo","csB"]}}]}
